  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { Hints : } \\int \\frac{d x}{x(x+1)}=\\int\\left(\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{x+1}\\right) d x=\\int \\frac{d x}{x}-\\int \\frac{d x}{x+1}=\\ln |x|-\\ln |x+1|+C=\\ln \\left|\\frac{x}{x+1}\\right|+C\n$$",
